# The worker image builds from what the repository tracks. A build from a
# checkout sends the same files with or without this list. A build from a
# working copy leaves out the installed packages (built for the host, not for
# the image), earlier builds and local secrets.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/out
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
vibe
internal
CLAUDE.md
.githooks/local-patterns
**/.vercel
.supabase/.temp
supabase/.temp
**/.DS_Store
**/*.pem
**/npm-debug.log*
